{"w":2400,"h":3115,"lines":[{"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.30566037495930987,"y":0.042041078029387724,"x":0.5981132086499702,"c":1,"h":0.017650834403080906},{"x":0.10000000302249883,"h":0.020539153372063135,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.091463414087555539,"w":0.35471697489420573,"c":1},{"t":"MODEL ANSWER","w":0.18113207499186199,"h":0.014562871244966691,"y":0.12933247779803958,"c":1,"x":0.10188679259840863},{"x":0.099999995096816854,"y":0.16715116253210027,"w":0.77735850016276042,"h":0.017441860977584267,"c":1,"t":"This model has been prepared by an examiner as an example of a very good answer."},{"w":0.77735850016276042,"h":0.017441860977584156,"x":0.099999995085484752,"c":1,"y":0.18604651136905415,"t":"However, please note that this is just one example out of many possible approaches."},{"c":1,"w":0.76603775024414067,"h":0.016063005841589373,"t":"Some people consider that the loss of individual species of plants and animals is the","x":0.11132074738380492,"y":0.22238372099856374},{"y":0.24127906983449721,"t":"main environmental problem of our time. Attempts to preserve rare or dying species","h":0.016102187899784126,"c":1,"x":0.11132075885314881,"w":0.76037734985351557},{"w":0.76792455037434904,"h":0.017441860977584267,"c":1,"y":0.26017441834599464,"x":0.11132074359243764,"t":"are carried out in zoos or other specialist plant and animal facilities, through breeding"},{"w":0.78311147054036456,"t":"programmes, preservation orders and other forms of protection and there was genuine","c":1,"y":0.27766675969830079,"x":0.10939434175903254,"h":0.019142826653261391},{"y":0.29651162764812389,"w":0.71320755004882819,"t":"sadness among many when the last surviving white rhino died earlier this year.","h":0.017441860977584156,"c":1,"x":0.11132075317718375},{"c":1,"t":"Survival of the fittest is nature's way of ruthlessly allowing weaker specimens to die","x":0.11124154782513396,"y":0.33198623558988771,"h":0.019675137295802392,"w":0.7529705810546875},{"t":"out, although mankind has also contributed to falling animal numbers through hunting","y":0.35319767448770978,"w":0.77169809977213544,"c":1,"x":0.11132076134010295,"h":0.015988371950671043},{"h":0.020669065482809224,"w":0.76615290323893226,"t":"and poaching. However, whether saving individual species should be the main tocus","x":0.11125477135488836,"y":0.37026663564990225,"c":1},{"h":0.017441860977584156,"c":1,"y":0.38953488346242515,"w":0.77924530029296868,"x":0.11132074598141457,"t":"of environmental protection is debatable. Climate change and excessive use of plastic"},{"c":1,"h":0.015988371950671043,"x":0.11132075654235171,"y":0.40843023262621714,"t":"are just two other major problems that deserve our attention.","w":0.54905659993489575},{"x":0.11132074689066675,"h":0.016079797977354371,"c":1,"y":0.44476744192823947,"t":"The evidence of climate change is there for us all to see: rising sea levels and","w":0.70377360026041669},{"y":0.46366279076599548,"h":0.016118980647663705,"x":0.11132074789348015,"w":0.72830190022786456,"t":"associated flooding with the loss of homes at low land levels are becoming more","c":1},{"h":0.015988371950671043,"w":0.76792455037434892,"c":1,"t":"frequent. Many countries and island communities are now calling for urgent action to","y":0.48255813960354599,"x":0.10943395110777032},{"w":0.75283014933268233,"h":0.018934531450577663,"t":"delay, halt or even reverse the process, although if we believe the experts, reversal","x":0.11132077625347013,"c":1,"y":0.4999999997922786},{"c":1,"x":0.1075471663422682,"y":0.51889534886294131,"w":0.76415095011393219,"t":"is impossible. Habitable areas are gradually shrinking, often for some of the poorest","h":0.018973714120886886},{"t":"groups of people, but there seems to be little obvious action taking place. If the major","y":0.53779069741573493,"w":0.7735848999023438,"h":0.017441860977584156,"c":1,"x":0.10943396505730808},{"y":0.55289375810775188,"w":0.74558512369791663,"t":"contributors to climate change will not support the reduction of greenhouse gases,","c":1,"x":0.11120332550769016,"h":0.022755764874322404},{"y":0.57412790702127303,"w":0.29245282491048175,"h":0.016051810268260081,"c":1,"t":"there is little hope for the future.","x":0.10943396481205468},{"w":0.75103368123372405,"c":1,"y":0.61044282140445272,"t":"Naturalists have also begun to expose the serious problems arising from discarded","h":0.018512416100165408,"x":0.11126907397891254},{"w":0.73408203125000004,"h":0.019292625750442549,"c":1,"t":"plastic waste. Birds and animals can die gruesome deaths through being trapped","x":0.11125998616082958,"y":0.62861108818536182},{"h":0.020234250593858749,"w":0.71144582112630206,"t":"or caught up in plastic bags or ropes, while the long process required for these","x":0.11125349061447262,"y":0.64792732293144628,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.11126208905993716,"t":"plastics to decay means that they remain a threat for many years to come. Worse,","h":0.020631141319813584,"y":0.66544312892818402,"w":0.74541330973307296},{"y":0.68604651136935979,"c":1,"w":0.76792455037434892,"t":"there is now beginning to be evidence of sea creatures ingesting smaller globules of","x":0.10943395114008637,"h":0.017441860977584156},{"c":1,"x":0.11126801422478971,"w":0.76614354451497402,"t":"disintegrating plastic, which harms them and all the other creatures in their particular","h":0.019734849060607074,"y":0.70311376064499997},{"c":1,"x":0.10914497829828136,"t":"food chain.","w":0.10638074239095051,"y":0.72254243080976766,"h":0.016054891652412029},{"w":0.75094340006510429,"y":0.76017441863074176,"t":"The loss of particular species, both flora and fauna, is cause for regret, but I do not","c":1,"h":0.019029688926961219,"x":0.11132075270305933},{"x":0.11127097536307218,"y":0.77744430717306168,"c":1,"w":0.76991048177083321,"h":0.019127487677205623,"t":"agree that they are the most important environmental problems these days. If climate"},{"c":1,"w":0.74727406819661446,"t":"change and damage from plastic continue, there will be less land and less food for","x":0.11127255782456899,"y":0.79635061287074838,"h":0.019906941366134467},{"c":1,"h":0.019252864019861593,"x":0.11120714138666889,"t":"everyone, including plants and animals.","y":0.81409728833424122,"w":0.36244415283203124},{"h":0.014534884147986871,"c":1,"t":"131","y":0.95058139506924122,"w":0.033962262471517013,"x":0.86981132154297214}]}